//   v8.51 (10/02/2026): pierce alerts/markers whose candle closes through the line against the HTF direction are labeled "Option 2: Reverse SHORT→LONG" / "Reverse LONG→SHORT" instead of "Entry: SHORT/LONG". No library change.
//   v8.52 (10/02/2026): HTF CBC Flip setups wait up to 10 candles (input) for a pullback into the flip's BRSG zone or the EMA20 with a close back on the trade side; no pullback = no setup. ESLib v96 -> import /14.
//   v8.53 (10/02/2026): flip pullback in two steps -- touch of the BRSG zone / EMA20 within 10 candles of the flip, then a green close back above it within 10 candles of the touch (ESLib v97 -> import /15).
//   v8.54 (10/02/2026): input "HTF CBC Flip: touch and close-back may be on separate candles" (default ON = v8.53 two-step; OFF = v8.52 same-candle rule). ESLib v98 -> import /16.
//   v8.55 (10/02/2026): HTF candle line adds AvgRange (avg high-low of the 20 HTF candles before it) and RangeX (this candle's range / that average) for the Alert Feed. No library change.
//   v8.56 (10/02/2026): HTF candle line also records the 4 HTF candles before it: Last4 (their ranges, newest first), Avg4 and RangeX4 (this range / Avg4). Info only -- not used for SL. No library change.
//   v8.57 (10/02/2026): the 4 HTF candles before the flip candle are recorded individually ("HTF Prev1..Prev4: H= L= R=") with Avg4 / RangeX4. Info only. No library change.
