//@version=6
indicator("v10.47", shorttitle = "10.47", overlay = true, behind_chart = false, calc_bars_count = 10000, max_labels_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500, max_boxes_count = 500)

// v4.87: Order Blocks' box-array helpers (f_obAdd/f_htfObAdd/f_obManage) moved to a published library
// (CBC_OrderBlocksLib, published under samuelsuss8) — library code compiles separately from the main
// script and doesn't count against CE10117.
// v4.96: user confirmed CBC_OrderBlocksLib is now actually version 2 (checked via Pine Editor
// autocomplete, not just the import line) — the earlier republish did eventually go through, it just
// took longer to register than expected. Reverted the v4.95 rename (CBC_OB_Lib2 isn't needed) and
// pointed this import back at the original library, now at /2, which has f_obUpdateSwing.
// v8.00: import /66 (next publish after /65, per user's standing instruction).
// v8.09: library renamed CBC_OrderBlocksLib -> ESLib per direct request. A renamed library publishes as
// a NEW library on TradingView, so this points at /1 as a placeholder until the real published number
// is reported back.
// v8.10: user-confirmed samuelsuss8/ESLib/1 is the real published number. Next republish will be /2.
// v8.88 (10/05/2026): "Setup Confirmed" -- during the "Min candles between setups" wait, a trigger in the SAME direction as the live setup no longer just disappears: no new box, but a "• Setup Confirmed: LONG/SHORT / By: <triggers> / Setup Entry: x" alert is sent (Alert Feed v82 shows the count on the setup). Trigger text built by f_ats_why (shared with the Trade Setup alert). Token relief: HTF CBC Flip long/short alert bullets merged (same text); a_st2 shared structure lines; HTF label size passed as the input string; London OR open = NY OR open - 6.5 h. ESLib/18.
// v8.89 (10/05/2026): "Min candles between setups" default 5 -> 10. Fix: restored "bool ag_l" (dropped in v8.88 -> CE10272); hf_on/ag_on token relief. ESLib/18.
// v8.90 (10/05/2026): new input "HTF EMA9/EMA20 Pierce replaces the current setup" (Setup Triggers, default OFF). ON = an HTF EMA9/20 Pierce bypasses "Min candles between setups" (ats_cooldown_ok), so it draws immediately and supersedes the live setup. ESLib/18.
// v8.91 (10/05/2026): Trade Setup alert gets "Fib zone: IN 15m <top> / <bot>" when the Entry is inside the HTF Fib golden pocket (50%-61.8%, same zone as the Fib box / table row). Alert Feed v82 shows it as a FIB badge. ESLib/18.
// v8.92 (10/06/2026): ⓘ setup info label at Entry (input "Show ⓘ setup info label", default ON; tooltip = direction, triggers, CBC chart TF / HTF, flip side, flop, Fib). Trade Setup alert text + Fib line moved to the library (f_ats_msg / f_ats_fib_txt / f_ats_info_lbl) -- same alert text. REQUIRES ESLib v99 rev7 published; import set to /21 -- change to the number TradingView gives.
// v8.93 (10/06/2026): "Minimum SL distance (pts)" default 4 -> 6. Import still /21 placeholder (ESLib v99 rev7).
// v8.94 (10/06/2026): new input "Setups: act on HTF flip at the HTF candle close" (Auto Trade Setup, default OFF). ON = on the chart candle that closes the HTF candle (8:42-8:45 on 3m/15m) the setup engine takes the HTF CBC as it closes -> old setup ends and the HTF CBC Flip setup draws at 8:45 on history and live (history used to lag ~12 min). Engine-only copies: ats_hd/ats_hb/ats_hs/ats_fb/ats_fs/ats_aw/ats_fch/ats_fcl replace htf_dir_*/htf_flip_*/htf_flip_away_from_ema20/htf_flip_candle_* inside the setup engine; OFF = identical to before. f_ats_why body moved to ESLib (rev8). Import /21 placeholder.
// v8.95 (10/06/2026): CE10295 fix -- v8.94 setup-engine HTF block wrapped in f_ats_hdir() (also returns ats_flip_ok, ats_eod, ats_tol); Setup Confirmed alert folded into f_ats_setup_alert() and its text moved to ESLib f_ats_conf_msg; NY minutes via f_ats_hm_ny (rev8). No behavior change. Import /21 placeholder.
