// v10.42 (10/27/2026): default "...flips >= per symbol" = "MES 2m 4" (MES 2m only: block new setups after 4+ HTF flips in the window). Daily stats 10/26: after the MTF gate, flips >= 4 blocked 9 of 40 MES 2m setups, 22 % win, -34.7 pts, negative in both halves. Other cases unchanged (unlisted -> checkbox, OFF). (2) MES 3m exits back to the base (pre-v10.28) exits: MES 3m removed from the SL1 x ATR, minimum SL, TP1 x ATR, close-at-TP1 and breakeven lists -> SL1 1.7 ATR + MES minimum 5 pts, TP1 1.7 ATR, 80 % at TP1, breakeven at TP1 ON, trail 1.7 ATR. Replay of the 43 real MES 3m setups 10/20-10/27 (replay within 0.3 pt of the actual result on 40/43): current exits -38.0, base exits -9.0, better in both halves (-40.4 -> -22.9, +2.4 -> +13.9); most of the gain is the wider stop (1.7 ATR + min 5 with TP1 2.0: -12.7). MGC 3m exits unchanged. Input defaults only.
// v10.43 (10/28/2026): exit markers (tiny letters) -- the stop exit now shows "S" only when SL1 was hit before TP1; after TP1 it shows "TR" (trailing stop) or "BE" (breakeven). Change is in ESLib rev37 (f_ats_draw_setup); CBC only bumps the import to ESLib/58 (user confirmed). No input or logic change.
