// v10.20 (10/19/2026): range-position gate (▌▌▌▌▌▌▌▌▌▌③, OFF): skip a long when the close is in the top X % of the last N bars' range and that range is under Y ATR (short: bottom X %). Defaults N 24, X 20, Y 5 + per-symbol Y override text. Replay 10/12-10/19 (86 setups): 24/20/5 blocked 27 (26 % win), +80.8 pts (MGC +61.3, MES +19.6); Y 6+ cost MES winners. Setup alert + ⓘ tooltip get "Range: 86% of 24-bar range · 4.3 ATR". ESLib2 f_rp, import /28 PLACEHOLDER.
